00:14:46.667 --> 00:14:48.400
If they're already an anti-Semite.

00:14:48.467 --> 00:14:49.833
-Oh, I see.
-Yeah.

00:14:51.567 --> 00:14:52.800
-Wanna throw it in here?
-Yeah.

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:55.200
-I'll open it.
-Really? No, you don't have to.

00:14:55.333 --> 00:14:56.733
I like to open a dumpster.

