more than the other guys? Or...

00:15:12.233 --> 00:15:14.067
I, I... It means that...

00:15:14.667 --> 00:15:18.433
he behaves in a way that one, one would...

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:22.100
perceive him to be gay more readily
than another person.

00:15:22.267 --> 00:15:24.033
All right, thank you for clearing that up.

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:25.067
Yep.

